{
  "description": "Boundary and edge serialization of positional AMQP method arguments: min/max fixed-width integers (octet, short, long, long-long), empty short/long strings and byte arrays, bit-packing run flush at exactly 8 bits and across a byte boundary, a single trailing bit, bit runs that do not start the stream, negative/zero floats, and the epoch timestamp.",
  "cases": [
